    <briefdescription>
<para>A forward iterator which reads text lines from a buffer. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class provides a forward iterator interface for reading one line at a time from a buffer. When default constructed the iterator will be the &quot;end&quot; iterator.</para>
<para>The iterator is aware of what line number it is currently processing. It strips blank lines by default, and comment lines given a comment-starting character.</para>
<para>Note that this iterator requires the buffer to be nul terminated. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
